WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:06,570
I need to quickly replenish my physical strength to cope with the strain.

2
00:00:06,570 --> 00:00:15,060
Sister Wang has sent a message

3
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:16,290
So small

4
00:00:16,290 --> 00:00:17,290
I just remembered

5
00:00:17,290 --> 00:00:19,290
When you dragged me away today

6
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:21,290
Did you leave something on the camper?

7
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:24,290
Do you have anything to eat or drink over there?

8
00:00:24,290 --> 00:00:27,290
My husband and I have discussed it and plan to leave the city tomorrow.

9
00:00:27,290 --> 00:00:28,290
This city is not safe now

10
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:30,290
Come with us

11
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:32,420
In addition to the usual five-seater car in my house,

12
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:34,420
There is also a seven-seat SUV

13
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:36,420
Mainly opened when I go back to my hometown during the Chinese New Year

14
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:38,700
You pack your luggage

15
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:39,700
Come with us out of the city first

16
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:45,000
If other cities were safer

17
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,000
You can go and live there

18
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,030
if you like

19
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:50,030
You can also go back to your hometown with us

20
00:00:50,030 --> 00:00:52,030
The house he and his husband bought in City C

21
00:00:52,030 --> 00:00:53,030
There’s a lot left on the mortgage

22
00:00:53,030 --> 00:00:55,030
In this case, I also want to leave.

23
00:00:55,030 --> 00:00:57,030
The countryside is always safer than the city

24
00:00:57,030 --> 00:00:59,030
Those who have land will never go hungry

25
00:00:59,030 --> 00:01:01,030
We'll come back when the situation is more stable.

26
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,030
The space cannot be exposed

27
00:01:02,030 --> 00:01:04,030
It's really inconvenient to follow others

28
00:01:04,030 --> 00:01:06,030
And I'm still used to being alone

29
00:01:06,030 --> 00:01:07,030
Thank you, Sister Wang

30
00:01:07,030 --> 00:01:09,030
But I won’t bother you anymore
